      "id": "get-view-point",
      "name": "GetViewPoint",
      "category": "GameplayDebuggerCategory",
      "signature": "GetViewPoint(Target, Owner PC, Out View Location, Out View Direction)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Target",
          "type": "FGameplayDebuggerCategory*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Owner PC",
          "type": "APlayerController*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Out View Location",
          "type": "FVector&"
        },
        {
          "name": "Out View Direction",
          "type": "FVector&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "protected : bool",
      "docs": "Returns view location and direction from replicated data if available or will extract it from\nthe provided player controller. The replicated data is used first since it might be provided\nfrom a detached camera.\n@return whether OutViewLocation and OutViewDirection were assigned to valid values\n@note Method is expected to always return valid outputs if valid controller is provided. Otherwise it\ndepends if the view information has been replicated before the methods gets called."
    },
